!
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.
.WAVE F
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.EXACC
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-9
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -5.0 10.0 0.01
.NO4IND
**EXACC
.OCCUPIED
energy -5.0  0.0  0.01
.VIRTUAL
energy  0.0  10.0  0.01
.PRINT
2
.MOINT_SCHEME
42
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACT
*END OF
